---
// 项目详情页 —— v23.8（方案 #9）：项目正文渲染 + 仓库/演示外链 + 技术栈 + 详情元行
import { getCollection, render } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SparkIcon from '../../components/SparkIcon.astro';
import PlaceholderCard from '../../components/PlaceholderCard.astro';

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  const entries = await getCollection('project');
  return entries.map((entry) => ({
    params: { slug: entry.id.replace(/^\d+-/, '') },
    props: { entry },
  }));
}

const { entry } = Astro.props;
const { Content, headings } = await render(entry);
const data = entry.data;
const minutes = Math.max(1, Math.round(((entry.body || '').replace(/\s/g, '').length) / 400));
const all = (await getCollection('project')).sort((a, b) => (a.data.date < b.data.date ? 1 : -1));
const idx = all.findIndex((e) => e.id === entry.id);
const older = idx >= 0 && idx < all.length - 1 ? all[idx + 1] : null;
---

<Base title={`${data.title} — 江衍 · Digital Space`} desc={data.desc}>
  <div class="work-page">
    <header class="work-head">
      <p class="mono work-eyebrow" data-enter>SPACE 02 / WORK DETAIL</p>
      <h1 class="page-title work-title icon-hover" data-enter><SparkIcon name="projects" />{data.title}</h1>
      <p class="lead work-lead" data-enter>{data.desc}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="work-body" data-reveal-group>
      <article class="prose work-main" data-reveal-item>
        {(entry.body || '').replace(/\s/g, '').length < 40 ? (
          <PlaceholderCard
            label="BUILDING"
            title="项目过程还在整理"
            note="背景、过程和踩过的坑都记在这里——内容整理好就上线。技术栈与链接见右侧。"
          />
        ) : (
          <Content />
        )}
      </article>

      <aside class="work-side" data-reveal-item aria-label="项目信息">
        {data.links.length > 0 && (
          <section class="side-block">
            <h2 class="side-label mono">链接 / LINKS</h2>
            <ul class="side-links">
              {data.links.map((l) => (
                <li>
                  <a class="side-link mono" href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                    {l.label} <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </section>
        )}
        <section class="side-block">
          <h2 class="side-label mono">技术栈 / STACK</h2>
          <p class="side-stack mono">{data.stack.join(' · ')}</p>
        </section>
        <section class="side-block">
          <h2 class="side-label mono">信息 / META</h2>
          <p class="side-meta mono">日期 · {data.date.replace(/-/g, '.')}</p>
          <p class="side-meta mono">分类 · {data.category}</p>
          <p class="side-meta mono">全文 · {entry.body?.replace(/\s/g, '').length || 0} 字 · 约 {minutes} 分钟</p>
        </section>
        {older && (
          <a class="side-next mono" href={`/projects/${older.id.replace(/^\d+-/, '')}`}>
            下一个项目 · {older.data.title}
          </a>
        )}
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .work-page {
    padding-block: clamp(2.2rem, 5vh, 3.6rem);
  }

  .work-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    color: var(--color-ink-faint);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .work-lead {
    margin-top: 18px;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .work-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 220px;
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
  }

  .work-main {
    max-width: 68ch;
    justify-self: center;
  }

  .work-side {
    position: sticky;
    top: 120px;
  }

  .side-block {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .side-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--color-ink-faint);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .side-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .side-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hair);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .side-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink-strong);
    border-color: var(--hair-frame);
  }

  .side-link .arrow {
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }

  .side-stack,
  .side-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .side-next {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faint);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-hair);
    padding-top: 12px;
    transition: color 180ms ease;
  }

  .side-next:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .work-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .work-side {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
